{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he considered her a harlot.</b> But what does it matter to him? Rather, he sought to go on his way. She lifted her eyes heavenward and said: 'Master of the Universe! Shall I not merit to bring forth a sage from the body of this righteous man?' Immediately the Holy One, blessed be He, sent Michael and turned him back. It is written here: ״ויט אליה״, and it is written: ״ותט לפני״. Just as there, by means of an angel, so too here, by means of an angel."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:36.119737197Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}